Subject: [PATCH 11/11] camerabin: flash LED through its V4L2 flash subdevice
 first, Release 12

jolla-camera runs under sailjail with /sys read-only, so the LED class
brightness file cannot be written ('Read-only file system'). With
CONFIG_V4L2_FLASH_LED_CLASS the flash LED also registers a V4L2 flash
subdevice named after it; the sandbox allows /dev/v4l-subdev* (libcamera
needs them). Torch mode at the highest torch intensity, the subdevice
kept open while the LED is on; sysfs remains the fallback.
---
